{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12311570","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12311570","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1231157001:1":{"text":"それはブルーに聞けよ。俺はあいつが何を書いてるのかも知らないんだ。","source_cn":"那你得问布鲁，我也不知道他在写什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86A66173F514A526","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1231157002:1":{"text":"あいつ、いつも俺に事細かに質問してくるんだ。船乗りの紐結び方とか、甲板を掃除する道具とか……","source_cn":"他总问我非常细节的问题，比如水手结怎么系，甲板用什么抛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEE5ADDD35F43813","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1231157003:1":{"text":"そんな常識が小説の材料になるのか？俺にはさっぱり分かんないよ。","source_cn":"这些常识真的能帮他写出好小说来吗？我搞不懂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x488F9A3ED4CE83D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1231157004:1":{"text":"だけど、憧れの眼差しで見られたら悪い気はしないよな！","source_cn":"不过，有人一直用憧憬的眼光看着自己，这感觉很不错！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC657074A34428849","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:水手阿波龙":{"text":"水夫アボロン","source":"水手阿波龙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}